listing:   hmp.py
toolchain: QEMU emulator version 8.2.2 (Debian 1:8.2.2+ds-0ubuntu1.18)
command:   python3 -I hmp.py 3 "info pci" qemu-system-x86_64 -machine q35 -display none -serial null -nographic -no-reboot -netdev user,id=n0 -device e1000,netdev=n0 -device qemu-xhci -device pcie-root-port,id=rp1,chassis=1,bus=pcie.0 -device virtio-rng-pci,bus=rp1
date:      2026-10-09T19:20:19Z
machine:   Linux x86_64 (cloud build container)
exit code: 0
note:      the SeaBIOS firmware ran for about 3 s first, so the BAR addresses are assigned
